@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5080
@apiKey = demo-secret

### Upstream A — hello
GET {{baseUrl}}/a/hello

### Upstream B — hello
GET {{baseUrl}}/b/hello

### Admin — info
GET {{baseUrl}}/_veyra/info

### Admin — config summary (requires API key when auth enabled)
GET {{baseUrl}}/_veyra/config/summary
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Health — live
GET {{baseUrl}}/_veyra/health/live

### Health — ready
GET {{baseUrl}}/_veyra/health/ready

### Health — startup
GET {{baseUrl}}/_veyra/health/startup

### Correlation header round-trip
GET {{baseUrl}}/a/hello
X-Correlation-ID: my-correlation-id-12345
